## Infrastructure Dependencies

DC01 provides Active Directory and DNS services to the Windows clients.

SRV01 provides DHCP and file services to the Windows clients.

Active Directory will later synchronize with Microsoft Entra ID through Entra Connect.

Microsoft Entra ID will provide identity services for Microsoft 365.

Windows endpoints will later be managed through Microsoft Intune.

ServiceNow will be used to manage incidents, requests, onboarding, offboarding, and IT service management workflows.

## Project Goal

The infrastructure is designed to provide a realistic enterprise environment for practicing Windows Server administration, identity management, cloud integration, endpoint management, PowerShell automation, troubleshooting, and IT service management.
